   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-rewards-distribution-round-19-260922-to-091022-1\" name=\"tec-rewards-distribution-round-19-260922-to-091022-1\"></a>TEC Rewards Distribution - round-19  - 26/09/22 to 09/10/22</h1>\n<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>26 September 2022 and 09 October 2022</strong>. We allocated <strong>3155.7</strong> TEC tokens for rewards, with a <strong>59:40</strong> split between Praise and Sourcecred. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute. Please note that the Sourcecred allocation corresponds to the <strong>9th retroactive Sourcecred distribution</strong>.  Check <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/tec-rewards-distribution-june-2022-pt-1/1107/3\">this post</a> for more information.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=10\" title=\":pray:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=10\" title=\":balance_scale:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=10\" title=\":memo:\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards/79c9740ce0c5e71fc2103e51beeea317e9e1b9a8/distribution_rounds/round-19/distribution_results/reports/round-19--general-round-analysis-report.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=10\" title=\":bar_chart:\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=10\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Username</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">r-x-x#8344</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">222.482</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">divine_comedian#5493</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">96.7636</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">chuygarcia.eth#6692</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">72.4483</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">jh#4856</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">70.8936</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">alantv#0964</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">67.1624</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Zeptimus#3359</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">66.5667</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">acidlazzer#5796</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">66.3506</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">miguelb#5176</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">60.7322</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">itsyaboi#2591</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">60.0108</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">GideonRo#3175</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">58.7298</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">sem(<img alt=\":cherry_blossom:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/cherry_blossom.png?v=10\" title=\":cherry_blossom:\"/>,<img alt=\":honeybee:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/image